[00:01.44]1. To whom do you belong?
[00:22.34]Which god do you now obey?
[00:26.52]Your master’s the one to whom you bow.
[00:30.38]He is your god; you serve him now.
[00:35.16]You cannot serve two gods;
[00:39.50]Devotion cannot be shared.
[00:43.82]And so in the end your choice will depend
[00:48.46]On how your heart is prepared.
[00:55.08]2. To whom do you belong?
[00:59.36]Which god will you now obey?
[01:03.66]For one god is false and one is true,
[01:08.16]So make your choice; it’s up to you.
[01:12.24]Will Caesar of this world
[01:16.58]Possess your allegiance still?
[01:21.26]Or will you obey the true God today
[01:25.66]By always doing his will?
[01:34.36]3. To whom do I belong?
[01:39.58]Jehovah I will obey.
[01:39.96]My Father in heaven I will serve;
[01:41.56]I’ll pay my vows without reserve.
[01:41.64]He bought me at great cost;
[02:26.42]Devoted to him I’ll stay.
[02:30.66]To him I will give each moment I live.
[02:34.88]His name I’ll honor each day.
